  "user": "Please look up transaction TX-0401 in my account records and verify its amount. Then explain which reason codes could apply; I have not yet told you what happened.",
  "answer": "Transaction **TX-0401** is in your account ACC-1005 and the amount is confirmed:\n\n- **Amount:** EUR 240.00\n- **Date:** 2026-07-20\n- **Merchant:** TechMart Online\n- **Type:** Card payment, outgoing\n- **Status:** Settled\n\nI also see a second payment to the same merchant for the same amount: **TX-0402**, EUR 240.00 on 2026-07-14. You may want to check whether that relates to what happened.\n\nBased on the reason codes available for disputes, these could apply, depending on what occurred:\n\n- **duplicate_charge:** You were charged more than once for the same purchase. TX-0401 and TX-0402 would fall under this if they are the same purchase.\n- **fraud_card_not_present:** A card payment was made without your authorization and without your physical card, for example online.\n- **unauthorized_debit:** Money left your account without your permission.\n- **goods_not_received:** You paid for goods that were never delivered.\n- **service_not_rendered:** You paid for a service that was never provided.\n\nTell me what happened and I can check whether a dispute is eligible for the matching reason code before anything is filed. I won't open a dispute without your confirmation.",
